{"id":"3780","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/3780_main_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio-and-cumulus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>蔽光高层云覆盖着天空，从中持续降下小到中雨。阴暗的云层是雨层云，但在拍照时无法识别，因为太阳没有被地平线上的云层完全掩盖。从通过云层传输的光量可以看出这一点：它足以照亮<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓云云种的最北端的积云顶部</span>。在这条被照亮的浓云线前面是一条<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云和中云线</span>；这条线在第一条的阴影下。含雨云的变薄标志着锋云带的后缘和积云正在这个云带后面的较冷空气中发展。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国美因茨","latitude":"纬度: 49° 58' 27'' N","longitude":"经度: 8° 13' 56'' E","date":"25 September 2012 1112 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.5.6","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.5.6"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/3780_syn_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio-and-cumulus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>地表图显示的是照片拍摄后不久的情况。冷锋已经过去，在锋后的雨层云覆盖了天空，降雨正要开始。气温逐渐降低，并且随着较冷的空气进入，下午的云型发生变化，出现积云，最后天气晴朗。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/3780_upper_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio-and-cumulus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测来自西南偏西74公里的站点，是从照片拍摄后两小时开始。它显示出从地表至385hPa处（7400米）存在大量水分。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/3780_sat_altostratus-opacus-praecipitatio-and-cumulus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>卫星图片显示的是照片拍摄后三小时的情况。较低洼的不列颠群岛是欧洲中部地区天气的驱动力。有一条细长的锋云带从德国经法国一直延伸到西班牙。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2012","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}